2026-08-08T14:40:01.5318753Z +     "\n",
2026-08-08T14:40:01.5318998Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-08-08T14:40:01.5319280Z +     "\n",
2026-08-08T14:40:01.5319686Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
